5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I hope we can choose a wonderful exhibition together. I shall start by looking into the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I agree we should be thorough. To ensure we don't repeat past mistakes, I'll look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs over three seasons.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm looking forward to this! To make sure we actually pick something people will love, I'll check the five years of visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts across ten seasons.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to ensure the gallery can physically handle the requirements of the next exhibition. I will look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to know where all the money goes! I'll check the mount-making charges and joiner's rate, and also the loan transport costs over three seasons. Let's find some secrets!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see such enthusiasm from everyone. To complement my first choice, I believe it would be wise to look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog as well.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,I have already selected my two items. I believe the data on shipping and transport will be the most revealing factors in this decision. I'll leave the rest to you all.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
12,1,2,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I've already got my two picks, Shion! I'm sticking with the visitor data. I think it's the most exciting part of the puzzle, don't you?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
14,1,2,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
15,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I have already selected my two items. I believe the structural and technical data will be essential for a realistic decision. I will pass for the rest of this round.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
16,1,2,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
17,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm all set too! I can't wait to see if I find any hidden treasure in those bills. I'm over for this round!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
18,1,2,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Since everyone else has finished their selections, I shall also conclude my turn. I look forward to seeing what we all discover.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
